ghtest;config;client;callbackUrl;params;authResult;result;tokenResult
⍝ Create OAuth client using CommonProviders
config←##.CommonProviders.GitHub 'authorizationCode'
config.clientId←credentials.github.clientId
config.clientSecret←credentials.github.clientSecret
client ← ##.SOAC.New config

⍝ Start temp jarvis server
callbackUrl←client.StartCallbackServer 3000 ⍝ Starts Jarvis server on port 3000

⍝ Generate authorization URL
params←(
    redirectUri: callbackUrl
    scope: 'read:user'
    custom: (
        ⍝ Custom params to be passed (Will not be parsed)
    )
)
authResult ← client.GetAuthorizationURL params

⍝ Show URL to user
⎕ ← 'Please visit: ', authResult.url

⍝ wait for code
client.LaunchURL authResult.url
result ← client.WaitForCallback ⍝ Waits until callback received. Autostops the Jarvis server



⍝ Check if successful
:If result.success
    ⍝ Exchange code for token (using namespace arguments)
    tokenResult ← client.GetToken (code: result.code ⋄ redirectUri: callbackUrl)

    :If tokenResult.success
        ⎕ ← 'Access Token: ', tokenResult.access_token
        ⎕ ← 'Refresh Token: ', tokenResult.refresh_token
        ⎕ ← 'Expires in: ', tokenResult.expires_in
    :Else
        ⎕ ← 'Token error: ', tokenResult.error_description
    :EndIf
:Else
    ⎕ ← 'Authorization error: ', result.error_description
:EndIf
